#   Stage 1  cleaning, per-experiment and combined BLUEs, diagnostics, histograms, one-row-per-genotype GWASpoly input (incl. did / did not break traits)
#   Stage 2  GWASpoly: additive + 1-dom, LOCO kinship, M.eff threshold. ONE 600-dpi PNG per trait x model with the Manhattan plot and its own QQ plot beside it
#            (same layout as the field-earliness GWAS), saved in 08_GWAS/K_only/Manhattan_with_QQ/
#   Stage 3  locus-zoom plots and candidate-gene workbook (Hillquist Table S8)
#   Stage 5  robustness checks for Ra01:725,408 (PF adjustment, class members, leave-one-out)
